  "gaps": [
    "All four pages were the SR5-filtered year pages (29-31 listings shown each), so unfiltered pages were not needed; first 20 listings per page recorded in page order.",
    "page_average is TrueCar's stated average sentence. The 2022 page quotes $33,489, identical to the 2016 page's figure (and the 2016 figure sits above every 2016 asking price on the page); the pages' FAQ sections also cite ~2,485-2,503 SR5 listings versus the 78-420 year totals, so these averages look like all-year boilerplate rather than per-year figures.",
    "note records cab / bed / engine / drivetrain as shown (2016 page shows bed as 6.1'/5'; 2024 page shows two listings as '5' Bed AT (SE)' with no drivetrain shown) plus any Sponsored/CPO badge. The 2016 page states all prices include dealer fees/add-ons; the 2022 page says the same.",
    "Every listing on the 2024 SR5 page is a Double Cab (4th-generation Tacoma); 2016-2022 pages mix Access Cab and Double Cab."
  ]
